# {{.Name}}

Development environment managed by [Neptuno](https://github.com/robertoplancarte/neptuno).

| Folder | Holds |
| --- | --- |
| `environments/<repo>/` | `base.env` plus one `<config>.env` per configuration |
| `dockerfiles/<repo>/` | The development `Dockerfile` and an optional `entrypoint.sh` |
| `procfiles/<repo>/` | The `Procfile` overmind runs |
| `repos/<repo>/` | The repo's source, as a git submodule |

`compose.yml` and `Caddyfile` are yours to edit. Shared services start out as
Caddy (`http://<repo>.localhost`), PostgreSQL (`localhost:5432`), Valkey
(`localhost:6379`) and SeaweedFS S3 (`localhost:8333`, `http://s3.localhost`).
